---
import Scene from './Scene.astro';
import '../styles/sections.css';
---
<section class="o4v" data-section="private">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Private by construction</p><h2>Made for two people, and only two.</h2></div>
    <div class="vcards">
      <div class="vc wide">
        <Scene name="lamp" />
        <span class="lbl3">Just the two of you</span>
        <ul class="nots" aria-label="Things Mọyì does not have">
          <li><s>Read receipts</s></li><li><s>Last seen</s></li><li><s>Typing dots</s></li><li><s>Followers</s></li><li><s>A feed</s></li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Two people. Nobody else.</h3>
        <p>No audience, and no sign of who opened the app or when. Leave a bond at any time, with no questions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vc">
        <Scene name="rain" />
        <span class="lbl3">Kind to missed days</span>
        <div class="days" role="img" aria-label="A week with six days written and one missed">
          <span><i></i>M</span><span><i></i>T</span><span><i></i>W</span><span><i class="miss"></i>T</span><span><i></i>F</span><span><i></i>S</span><span><i></i>S</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Miss a day. Nothing is lost.</h3>
        <p>Only the streak count resets. Nobody is told, and nobody is waiting on you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vc">
        <Scene name="bed" />
        <span class="lbl3">Honest about privacy</span>
        <ul class="yes" aria-label="What Mọyì promises">
          <li>No ads</li><li>Never sold</li><li>Explained in plain words</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Your words stay yours.</h3>
        <p>No ads, and your words are never sold. Entries are not end to end encrypted, and we explain why in plain words.</p>
        <a href="/privacy">Read the privacy page</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
